ting the cubes and avoiding obstacles. Each cut is strongly supported by great sound and visual effects to emphasize the rhythm.", "short_description": "Beat Saber is a VR rhythm game where your goal is to slash the beats which perfectly fit into precisely handcrafted music."}]}, "developer_name": "Beat Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://beatsaber.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://beatsaber.com/", "publisher_name": "Beat Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://beatsaber.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["MUSIC", "SPORTS", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "458995789043230"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 20, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "27960603130225640"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1603833474798117"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1570801707801233"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1609434833261854"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "501246542758334"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "556795246546777"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "763427945403123"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "520136543662306"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "759821042388261"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "779307970231927"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "964427474800955"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "932171208057780"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "333786537325310"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "